msgid "Capabilities"
msgstr "功能"

msgid "spaCR follows an image-based screen from raw microscopy files to a ranked hit list. This page gives the full map; the :doc:`Python API quickstart <python_api>` and interactive tutorials show the individual routes."
msgstr "spaCR 跟随一次基于图像的筛选，从原始显微文件一直到排序后的命中列表。本页给出完整的功能图；:doc:`Python API 快速入门 <python_api>` 和交互式教程展示了各条具体路线。"

msgid "Core screen workflow"
msgstr "核心筛选工作流程"

msgid "Mask"
msgstr "掩膜"

msgid "Mask prepares TIFF, OME-TIFF, LIF, CZI and ND2 acquisitions and segments cells, nuclei, pathogens and organelles with Cellpose. It supports 2-D, volumetric and time-series data, estimates object diameter, and can exchange mask corrections with the layer viewer or napari."
msgstr "掩膜模块准备 TIFF、OME-TIFF、LIF、CZI 和 ND2 采集数据，并使用 Cellpose 分割细胞、细胞核、病原体和细胞器。它支持二维、体数据和时间序列数据，可估计对象直径，并能与图层查看器或 napari 交换掩膜校正。"

msgid "The objects are not a fixed set of four. A project has a cell, a nucleus and a pathogen, a cytoplasm derived from them, and as many organelle slots as ``number_of_organelles`` asks for -- from none up to twenty-six. Each slot is independent, with its own channel, diameter, detection method and morphology."
msgstr "对象并不是固定的四种。一个项目包含细胞、细胞核和病原体，由它们派生的细胞质，以及 ``number_of_organelles`` 要求数量的细胞器槽位——从零到二十六个。每个槽位相互独立，拥有自己的通道、直径、检测方法和形态。"

msgid "A slot is given a morphology preset -- punctate, vesicular, spherical, filamentous, tubular, reticular, cisternal, toroidal, crescent, or custom -- and the preset chooses the detection strategy, one of spots, network, irregular or ring."
msgstr "每个槽位会被指定一种形态预设——点状、囊泡状、球形、丝状、管状、网状、扁囊状、环形、新月形或自定义——预设决定检测策略，即 spots、network、irregular 或 ring 之一。"

msgid "Mask generation lays out the per-object settings as one table under **Per-object settings**, with a column for each object whose channel is set; the cell column is always shown. An object's channel is set on the ordinary form, and a hidden object's answers are kept for when its channel is set again. Every object has a **Remove background** check box, and the cell column also has **Adjust cells**. **Add a filter** adds a row that filters objects on any scikit-image regionprop, such as area or mean intensity; each object's cell takes ``200 – 5000``, a minimum alone (``200``), a maximum alone (``– 5000``) or a blank for no filter. These rows are the ``object_filters`` setting. Choosing a Cellpose 3 model for an object shows a **Cellpose 3** category with that backend's own settings. **Quality Control** holds the segmentation checks together with output, storage, runtime and reliability settings."
msgstr "掩膜生成将逐对象设置排列为 **Per-object settings** 下的一张表，每个已设置通道的对象占一列；细胞列始终显示。对象的通道在常规表单中设置，隐藏对象的设置值会被保留，待其通道再次设置时使用。每个对象都有一个 **去除背景** 复选框，细胞列还有 **调整细胞**。**添加过滤器** 会添加一行，可按任何 scikit-image regionprop （例如面积或平均强度）过滤对象；每个对象的单元格可填写 ``200 – 5000``、单独的最小值（``200``）、单独的最大值（``– 5000``），或留空表示不过滤。这些行构成 ``object_filters`` 设置。为某个对象选择 Cellpose 3 模型时，会显示 **Cellpose 3** 类别及该后端自己的设置。**质量控制** 包含分割检查以及输出、存储、运行和可靠性设置。"

msgid "Mask's **Live** preview shows the result as **Overlay**, **Masks**, **Flows** or **Cell probability**. Right-click a picture to **Save as PNG…** or **Save as PDF…**. Once a session has produced more than one mask, **Compare masks…** lays the masks and images you tick over one another, each with its own opacity and stacking order, in a panel of its own."
msgstr "掩膜的 **实时** 预览以 **叠加**、**掩膜**、**流场** 或 **细胞概率** 显示结果。右键单击图片可选择 **Save as PNG…** 或 **Save as PDF…**。一次会话生成多个掩膜后，**比较掩膜…** 会在单独的面板中将您勾选的掩膜和图像相互叠加，每个都有自己的不透明度和叠放顺序。"

msgid "Measure"
msgstr "测量"

msgid "Measure writes per-object morphology, intensity, texture, radial, spatial and colocalization features to ``measurements.db``. It can save classifier-ready object crops, estimate illumination correction from a plate, restrict work to a region of interest and report segmentation quality before a run."
msgstr "测量模块将每个对象的形态、强度、纹理、径向、空间和共定位特征写入 ``measurements.db``。它可以保存可直接用于分类器的对象裁剪图，根据孔板估计照明校正，将处理限制在感兴趣区域内，并在运行前报告分割质量。"

msgid "Measure's settings are grouped as **Input & Experiment**, **Mask & Channel Mapping**, **Image Preprocessing** (with **Image Deconvolution (PSF)** and **Illumination Correction**), **Features**, **Object Filtering**, **Crop Output**, **3D Calibration (Beta)** and **Postprocessing** (with **Runtime & Reliability**). The segmentation-quality verdict is opt-in: the **QC** switch beside **3D** and **Time** opens it in a popup, and closing the popup turns the switch off."
msgstr "测量模块的设置分组为 **输入与实验**、**掩膜与通道映射**、**图像预处理** （包括 **图像去卷积（PSF）** 和 **照明校正**）、**特征**、**对象过滤**、**裁剪图输出**、**三维校准（Beta）** 和 **Postprocessing** （包括 **运行与可靠性**）。分割质量评判需要主动开启：**3D** 和 **时间** 旁边的 **QC** 开关会在弹出窗口中打开它，关闭弹出窗口即关闭该开关。"

msgid "Annotate and Classify"
msgstr "标注与分类"

msgid "Annotate provides a keyboard-driven crop grid, records labels directly in the project database and can rank an active-learning queue by uncertainty. A page holds as many crops as fit and never scrolls; the rest are on the next page. After **Suggest…**, suggested crops carry a **?** badge: click one or press **Y** to confirm it, right-click or press **N** to reject it, and **U** undoes. **Confirm the rest of the page** and **Reject the rest of the page** judge every remaining suggestion at once. Rejections are kept and inform the next round of training. Classify trains PyTorch image models or classical and boosted models from measurement tables. Checkpoints record their dataset, split rule, class balance and held-out metrics. The **Essentials** view of Classify holds what is needed to choose and train either family — an image model such as ResNet or MaxViT, or a tabular model such as XGBoost or a random forest — and greys the settings of the family not chosen."
msgstr "标注模块提供由键盘驱动的裁剪图网格，将标签直接记录到项目数据库中，并可按不确定性对主动学习队列排序。一页显示尽可能多的裁剪图且不会滚动；其余的在下一页。执行 **建议...** 后，建议的裁剪图带有 **?** 徽标：单击或按 **Y** 确认，右键单击或按 **N** 拒绝，**U** 撤销。**确认本页其余项** 和 **拒绝本页其余项** 会一次性判定所有剩余建议。拒绝结果会被保留，并为下一轮训练提供信息。分类模块根据测量表训练 PyTorch 图像模型或经典模型和提升（boosted）模型。检查点会记录其数据集、划分规则、类别平衡和留出指标。分类的 **Essentials** 视图包含选择和训练任一系列所需的内容——ResNet 或 MaxViT 等图像模型，或 XGBoost 或随机森林等表格模型——未选中系列的设置会显示为灰色。"

msgid "Classify CV also offers optional rotations and reflections at inference time. See :doc:`classifier_evaluation` for the aggregation methods, original and mean probabilities, and orientation-stability flags."
msgstr "分类 CV 还提供推理时可选的旋转和镜像。关于汇总方法、原始概率和平均概率以及方向稳定性标记，请参阅 :doc:`classifier_evaluation`。"

msgid "Map Barcodes"
msgstr "映射条形码"

msgid "Barcode mapping decodes row, column and gRNA barcodes from FASTQ reads, joins them to imaged wells and reports abundance, collision, unmapped-read and library-coverage checks."
msgstr "条形码映射从 FASTQ 读段中解码行、列和 gRNA 条形码，将其与成像的孔关联，并报告丰度、冲突、未映射读段和文库覆盖度检查。"

msgid "Regression"
msgstr "回归"

msgid "Regression estimates guide, gene, condition and control effects. Its model families cover continuous, fractional, binary and count responses, robust and quantile fits, penalised high-dimensional designs, mixed effects and guide permutation. Diagnostics and run summaries are written beside the result."
msgstr "回归估计向导、基因、条件和对照的效应。其模型系列涵盖连续、比例、二元和计数型响应，稳健拟合和分位数拟合，带惩罚的高维设计，混合效应以及向导置换。诊断信息和运行摘要写在结果旁边。"

msgid "Planning, quality control and exploration"
msgstr "规划、质量控制与探索"

msgid "**Power and Design** estimate cell and well requirements and lay out plates, controls and replicates."
msgstr "**Power and Design** 估算所需的细胞数和孔数，并规划孔板、对照和重复。"

msgid "**QC Dashboard** combines segmentation, plate, annotation-agreement and leakage checks."
msgstr "**QC Dashboard** 汇总分割、孔板、标注者一致性和泄漏检查。"

msgid "**Batch correction** provides centering, z-scoring, robust z-scoring, control centering and ComBat with protected biological covariates."
msgstr "**批次校正** 提供中心化、z 分数标准化、稳健 z 分数标准化、对照中心化以及保护生物学协变量的 ComBat。"

msgid "**Graph Builder, gates and linked views** connect summary plots to the object crops behind them."
msgstr "**Graph Builder、门控和联动视图** 将汇总图与其背后的对象裁剪图关联起来。"

msgid "**Feature, dose-response, control-chart and outlier views** inspect a result without an export/re-import cycle."
msgstr "**特征、剂量反应、控制图和离群值视图** 无需导出/重新导入即可检查结果。"

msgid "**Layer and lineage views** connect images, masks and the cell → nucleus → pathogen object hierarchy."
msgstr "**图层和谱系视图** 将图像、掩膜以及细胞 → 细胞核 → 病原体的对象层级关联起来。"

msgid "In **Live Preview**, **QC** image views and the raw/enhanced comparison, wheel zoom keeps the image point beneath the pointer in place. This also works when the image is smaller than its viewport; **Fit** or opening a new image resets the extra navigation space. Linked comparison views update together after the zoom. Orthogonal image views zoom around the pointer without moving the crosshair's selected position."
msgstr "在 **Live Preview**、**QC** 图像视图以及原始/增强比较中，滚轮缩放会使指针下方的图像点保持不动。当图像小于视口时同样有效；**适应窗口** 或打开新图像会重置额外的导航空间。缩放后，联动的比较视图会一起更新。正交图像视图围绕指针缩放，而不会移动十字准线的选定位置。"

msgid "For Toxoplasma compartment-intensity comparisons, see :doc:`recruitment`."
msgstr "关于弓形虫区室强度比较，请参阅 :doc:`recruitment`。"

msgid "Reproducibility and interoperability"
msgstr "可重复性与互操作性"

msgid "Every run can record its identifier, seed, resolved settings and outputs. Interrupted workflows can resume from checkpoints, and the run history can compare settings and artefacts. Measurements export to AnnData; optional integrations read or write OME-Zarr, connect to OMERO and send masks to napari."
msgstr "每次运行都可以记录其标识符、随机种子、解析后的设置和输出。中断的工作流程可以从检查点继续，运行历史可以比较设置和产物。测量结果可导出为 AnnData；可选的集成可以读写 OME-Zarr、连接 OMERO 并将掩膜发送到 napari。"

msgid "How a module is reached"
msgstr "如何进入模块"

msgid "The home screen groups modules into four categories -- **Core**, **Data**, **Tools** and **Assays** -- and twenty-one modules have a tile in one of them. Core is the pipeline you run in order; Data is what goes in and what comes out of it; Tools are the instruments you point at a project rather than steps the pipeline takes on its own; Assays are the quantitative readouts. Make Masks is filed under **Tools**."
msgstr "主页将模块分为四个类别——**核心**、**数据**、**工具** 和 **实验分析**——其中二十一个模块在某个类别中有磁贴。核心是按顺序运行的流程；数据是流程的输入和输出；工具是您用于处理项目的工具，而不是流程自行执行的步骤；实验分析是定量读数。创建掩膜归在 **工具** 下。"

msgid "A TILE IS NOT THE ONLY WAY IN, and most modules do not have one. A tile says \"start here\", and a module that answers a question about a run somebody else started is not a place to start. Those open instead from:"
msgstr "磁贴并不是唯一的入口，而且大多数模块没有磁贴。磁贴的意思是“从这里开始”，而用于回答别人发起的运行相关问题的模块并不是起点。这些模块改为从以下位置打开："

msgid "**a button on their host's masthead** -- as a page beside that host's settings, already pointed at the same project. Investigate Hit and Prediction Profiler open from Regression; Format Converter and External Masks from Import; Layer Viewer, Control Charts and Outliers from QC."
msgstr "**其宿主模块标题栏上的按钮**——作为宿主设置旁边的一个页面打开，并已指向同一项目。Investigate Hit 和 Prediction Profiler 从回归打开；格式转换器和外部掩膜从导入打开；Layer Viewer、Control Charts 和 Outliers 从 QC 打开。"

msgid "**the Help menu**, for the ones that inspect or administer work that already exists rather than belonging behind any one module -- Run History, Pipeline Graph, Project Browser, Database Browser, Report, Data Manager, Plate Queue, Batch Runner and Distributed Jobs."
msgstr "**帮助菜单**，用于检查或管理已有工作、而不隶属于任何单个模块的那些模块——运行历史、Pipeline Graph、Project Browser、数据库浏览器、报告、数据管理器、孔板队列、批处理运行器和分布式作业。"

msgid "**the command palette** (Ctrl+K), which reaches EVERY module, tiled or not. It is the one route with no exceptions, and the keyboard user's navigation."
msgstr "**命令面板** （Ctrl+K），可到达所有模块，无论是否有磁贴。这是唯一没有例外的路线，也是键盘用户的导航方式。"

msgid "None of them is second-class: they are shipped, translated and documented like any other module, and the ones that are pipelines still run headlessly under ``spacr-run``."
msgstr "它们都不是次要的：它们与其他模块一样随软件发布、经过翻译并有文档，其中属于流程的模块仍可通过 ``spacr-run`` 无界面运行。"

msgid "Host"
msgstr "宿主"

msgid "Opens from its masthead"
msgstr "从其标题栏打开"

msgid "Timelapse"
msgstr "延时成像"

msgid "Illumination Correction, AnnData Export, Motility Assay"
msgstr "照明校正、导出 AnnData、运动性分析"

msgid "Annotate"
msgstr "标注"

msgid "Annotator Agreement"
msgstr "标注者一致性"

msgid "Classify"
msgstr "分类"

msgid "Classifier Evaluation, Explain CV Model, Activation Maps"
msgstr "分类器评估、解释 CV 模型、激活图"

msgid "Barcode QC"
msgstr "条形码质控"

msgid "Volcano Explorer, Hit List, Methods & Results"
msgstr "火山图浏览器、命中列表、方法与结果"

msgid "Image UMAP"
msgstr "图像 UMAP"

msgid "Image Scatter, PCA"
msgstr "图像散点图、PCA"

msgid "Make Masks"
msgstr "创建掩膜"

msgid "Cellpose Workbench, Mask the whole folder, Model Compare, Model Zoo, Curate, Napari Bridge"
msgstr "Cellpose 工作台、为整个文件夹生成掩膜、模型比较、模型库、校正、napari 桥接"

msgid "Parameter Sweep is reached a third way: it is a panel on the Regression screen, opened by the **Parameter sweep** switch on its settings form."
msgstr "参数扫描通过第三种方式进入：它是回归屏幕上的一个面板，通过其设置表单上的 **参数扫描** 开关打开。"

msgid "Picking up where you left off"
msgstr "从上次中断处继续"

msgid "**Session restore**: every ordinary start reopens the module that was on screen when spaCR last closed or crashed, with its settings and input folder. No run is started. While the status bar says what was reopened, its **Open fresh** button puts that module's default settings back and goes to Home; ``spacr-qt --fresh`` skips the restore for one start. Turn it off in **Preferences → Modules → Session** (on by default). A module named on the command line, or a Force restart record, takes precedence."
msgstr "**会话恢复** ：每次正常启动都会重新打开 spaCR 上次关闭或崩溃时屏幕上的模块，并恢复其设置和输入文件夹。不会启动任何运行。在状态栏显示重新打开了哪些内容时，其 **全新打开** 按钮会恢复该模块的默认设置并返回主页； ``spacr-qt --fresh`` 可在一次启动中跳过恢复。在 **偏好 → 模块 → 会话** 中关闭此功能（默认开启）。命令行中指定的模块或 Force restart 记录优先。"

msgid "**Settings autosave**: every 30 seconds the unsaved settings of every open module are kept as a draft in the preference store; nothing is written when nothing changed. A clean exit drops the drafts. If spaCR ended without closing, the next start asks once whether to restore them (drafts identical to the reopened session are not asked about). The same behaviour applies on Linux, macOS and Windows, because the store is Qt's own settings store."
msgstr "**设置自动保存** ：每 30 秒，各个已打开模块的未保存设置会作为草稿保存在偏好存储中；没有变化时不写入任何内容。正常退出会丢弃草稿。如果 spaCR 未经关闭就结束，下次启动时会询问一次是否恢复这些草稿（与重新打开的会话相同的草稿不会询问）。Linux、macOS 和 Windows 上的行为相同，因为该存储是 Qt 自身的设置存储。"

msgid "Undo and redo"
msgstr "撤销与重做"

msgid "**Ctrl+Z** undoes and **Ctrl+Shift+Z** or **Ctrl+Y** redoes in a module's settings panel, in the Gate Editor and in Annotate:"
msgstr "在模块的设置面板、Gate Editor 和标注中，**Ctrl+Z** 撤销，**Ctrl+Shift+Z** 或 **Ctrl+Y** 重做："

msgid "in the **settings panel**, each changed setting is one step. Loading settings, applying a template or replaying a run does not add steps. While you are typing in a text field, Ctrl+Z undoes the typing first;"
msgstr "在 **设置面板** 中，每更改一项设置算一步。加载设置、应用模板或重放运行不会增加步骤。在文本框中输入时，Ctrl+Z 会先撤销输入的内容；"

msgid "in the **Gate Editor**, each change to the gates (drawing, moving, renaming or deleting a gate) is one step;"
msgstr "在 **Gate Editor** 中，对门控的每次更改（绘制、移动、重命名或删除门控）算一步；"

msgid "in **Annotate**, **U** and Ctrl+Z undo the last label and Ctrl+Shift+Z or Ctrl+Y puts it back;"
msgstr "在 **标注** 中，**U** 和 Ctrl+Z 撤销最后一个标签，Ctrl+Shift+Z 或 Ctrl+Y 将其恢复；"

msgid "the **Make Masks** editor keeps its own **Undo** and **Redo**."
msgstr "**创建掩膜** 编辑器有自己的 **撤销** 和 **重做**。"

msgid "Running jobs"
msgstr "正在运行的任务"

msgid "**Help → Window → Jobs** opens the **Jobs** panel at the right edge of the window. It lists every job that is running, with its module, a progress bar, the time elapsed and its last output line. **Cancel** asks that job to stop. With nothing running, the panel says **No jobs are running.**"
msgstr "**帮助 → 窗口 → 任务** 会在窗口右侧打开 **任务** 面板。它列出每个正在运行的任务，以及其模块、进度条、已用时间和最后一行输出。**取消** 会请求该任务停止。没有任何任务运行时，面板显示 **没有正在运行的作业。**"

msgid "Two spaCR windows"
msgstr "两个 spaCR 窗口"

msgid "You can open more than one spaCR window. When a module runs, spaCR claims its source folder, which holds ``measurements.db`` and the results, and the Queue screen claims the plate queue. If another window already uses that folder or queue, **Project open in another window** names the other process and offers:"
msgstr "您可以打开多个 spaCR 窗口。模块运行时，spaCR 会占用其源文件夹（其中包含 ``measurements.db`` 和结果），队列屏幕会占用孔板队列。如果另一个窗口已在使用该文件夹或队列，**项目已在另一个窗口中打开** 会指出另一个进程并提供以下选项："

msgid "**Open read-only**: look without writing. This window then refuses to run a pipeline that writes there, and the Queue screen cannot change or run the queue;"
msgstr "**以只读方式打开**：只查看不写入。此窗口随后会拒绝运行向该处写入的流程，队列屏幕也无法更改或运行队列；"

msgid "**Continue anyway**: write as well, when you are sure the other window is idle. Two windows writing the same queue, database or results folder can corrupt them;"
msgstr "**仍然继续**：同时写入，仅在确定另一个窗口处于空闲时使用。两个窗口写入同一队列、数据库或结果文件夹可能会将其损坏；"

msgid "**Cancel**."
msgstr "**取消**。"

msgid "The answer is remembered for that folder until the window closes. A window that ended without closing does not keep its claims: the next window takes them over. The lock files are in ``~/.spacr/locks``; set ``SPACR_LOCK_DIR`` to keep them elsewhere."
msgstr "在窗口关闭之前，该文件夹的选择会被记住。未正常关闭而结束的窗口不会保留其占用：下一个窗口会接管。锁文件位于 ``~/.spacr/locks``；设置 ``SPACR_LOCK_DIR`` 可将其保存在其他位置。"

msgid "Accessibility"
msgstr "无障碍"

msgid "Every control has a name that screen readers announce, taken from its label, tooltip or placeholder, and the names follow the interface language. **Tab** moves out of text boxes and tables to the next control instead of typing a tab. **Preferences → Appearance → Theme** offers **High contrast**, in which all text has a contrast ratio of at least 7:1 against its background."
msgstr "每个控件都有屏幕阅读器会朗读的名称，取自其标签、工具提示或占位文本，并且名称跟随界面语言。**Tab** 会从文本框和表格移到下一个控件，而不是输入制表符。**偏好 → 外观 → 主题** 提供 **高对比度**，其中所有文字与背景的对比度至少为 7:1。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Data-art themes"
msgstr "数据艺术主题"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Under **Preferences** → **Appearance**, **Theme** selects the interface palette; the ten night palettes remain available. **Animation** chooses a decorative background independently, or **None** to stop it. These backgrounds do not display project measurements. The main window defaults to **spaCR field**; the Settings backdrop defaults to **None**."
msgstr "在 **偏好** → **外观** 中，**主题** 选择界面的配色方案；十种夜间配色方案仍可使用。**动画** 独立选择装饰性背景，或选择 **无** 将其停止。这些背景不显示项目测量结果。主窗口默认使用 **spaCR field**；设置窗口的背景默认为 **无**。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "The animation menu lists **spaCR field**, **spaCR advection**, **spaCR growth**, **spaCR waves**, **spaCR blobs**, **spaCR aurora**, **spaCR stratified**, and **spaCR spinn**, in that order."
msgstr "动画菜单依次列出 **spaCR field**、**spaCR advection**、**spaCR growth**、**spaCR waves**、**spaCR blobs**、**spaCR aurora**、**spaCR stratified** 和 **spaCR spinn**。"

msgid "**spaCR field** — A crisp gravitational dot field with optional local mouse influence and expanding ripples."
msgstr "**spaCR field** — 清晰的引力点阵场，可选局部鼠标影响，并呈现向外扩散的波纹。"

msgid "**spaCR advection** — Fine particles form evolving vortices and branching currents, with optional mouse gravity."
msgstr "**spaCR advection** — 精细粒子形成不断演变的涡旋和分支流，可选择启用鼠标引力。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "**spaCR growth** — Short mycelial segments grow from one starting point per colony and fork repeatedly. Each fork redirects the continuing tip and starts a daughter tip, so the branched front advances across the screen. Density controls the number of live tips. Older trails fade as new colonies begin; visible ink stays within a quarter of the screen."
msgstr "**spaCR growth** — 每个菌落的短菌丝段从一个起点生长，并不断分叉。每次分叉都会改变原有生长尖端的方向，并产生一个新的子尖端，使分支前沿向屏幕其他区域推进。密度控制活跃尖端的数量。随着新菌落出现，旧轨迹逐渐消退；可见图案始终限制在屏幕面积的四分之一以内。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "**spaCR waves** — Round points carry travelling waves and move away from the mouse within its enabled radius."
msgstr "**spaCR waves** — 圆点承载传播的波纹，并在已启用的鼠标影响半径内远离鼠标。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "**spaCR blobs** — Soft colour blobs, large and small, drift and slowly change size."
msgstr "**spaCR blobs** — 大小不同的柔和色块缓慢漂移，并逐渐改变大小。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "**spaCR aurora** — Irregular curtains of fine rays rise from luminous folds, fan towards the sky, and change length and brightness independently. The spaCR palette uses green with pink upper light for this theme; other selected palettes remain available."
msgstr "**spaCR aurora** — 细光束组成不规则的帘幕，从明亮的褶皱处升起，朝天空呈扇形展开，并各自改变长度和亮度。此主题的 spaCR 调色板使用绿色和顶部的粉色光；也可以继续使用其他选定的调色板。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "**spaCR stratified** — A slow starfield moves in three depth layers; **spaCR stratified direction** selects up, down or random travel."
msgstr "**spaCR stratified** — 缓慢的星点场在三个深度层中移动；**spaCR stratified 方向** 选择向上、向下或随机方向的运动。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "**spaCR spinn** — Fine paper facets move gently and spin locally in response to the mouse. Rotation is fastest beside the pointer and fades smoothly to zero at the Mouse gravity radius; changing the radius changes the affected area."
msgstr "**spaCR spinn** — 细薄的纸片状面片轻柔移动，并根据鼠标位置局部旋转。越靠近指针，旋转越快；速度在鼠标引力半径的边缘平滑降至零。改变半径会改变受影响的区域。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "**Mouse gravity radius** sets the affected area as a percentage of the shorter screen edge. Its default is **15%**; set it to **0** to disable mouse influence. **Animation density** changes the number of elements independently of **Animation detail**, which changes drawing resolution. Density has a minimum of **1%**; increasing Detail does not trim the chosen population. The renderer bounds its sampling work within the screen's pixel budget. Select **Random** in **Animation palette** for per-element colours. Fresh installations use **Dark**, **spaCR field** and the **spaCR** animation palette, with Density **10%**, Gravity **15%**, Detail, Speed and Size **100%**, and Page opacity **60%**. **Dot blinking** controls the percentage of visible dots that flash white: **0** switches it off (the default), and nonzero values range from 0.00001% to 10%. The setting applies to spaCR field, spaCR advection, spaCR waves and spaCR stratified. Field fade is on. The blue rim uses a relative perimeter length of **17%**, Chase **50%**, centred alignment, **Beat** mode and a **1.5 s** cycle. Existing saved preferences remain in effect until changed or reset."
msgstr "**鼠标引力半径** 以屏幕较短边长的百分比设置影响区域。默认值为 **15%** ；设为 **0** 可禁用鼠标影响。**动画密度** 控制元素数量，与改变绘制分辨率的 **动画细节** 相互独立。密度最低为 **1%** ；增加细节不会减少已选定的元素数量。渲染器将采样工作限制在屏幕像素预算内。在 **动画调色板** 中选择 **随机** 可为每个元素使用随机颜色。新安装默认使用 **深色** 、**spaCR field** 和 **spaCR** 动画调色板，密度为 **10%** ，引力为 **15%** ，细节、速度和大小均为 **100%** ，页面不透明度为 **60%** 。**点闪烁** 控制闪烁为白色的可见点所占的百分比：**0** 禁用闪烁（默认值），非零范围为 0.00001% 至 10%。该设置适用于 spaCR field、spaCR advection、spaCR waves 和 spaCR stratified。场淡出已启用。蓝色边缘光使用周长的 **17%** 作为相对长度，跟随为 **50%** ，以指针为中心对齐，模式为 **Beat** ，周期为 **1.5 s** 。已有的已保存偏好设置会保留，直到用户更改或重置。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "**Animation background colour** sets the background independently of the animation palette. Until you choose a colour, it follows the page theme; **Theme colour** restores that behaviour. The chosen colour's brightness is kept within the active Dark or Light theme's range. It applies to the main window, module screens and animated settings popups. A full-screen wallpaper can cover the background fill."
msgstr "**动画背景颜色** 可独立于动画调色板设置背景。在您选择颜色之前，背景会跟随页面主题；**主题颜色** 可恢复这一行为。所选颜色的亮度始终保持在当前深色或浅色主题的范围内。该颜色应用于主窗口、模块页面和带动画的设置弹窗。全屏壁纸可能遮盖背景填充颜色。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "**Popup wave frequency** sets automatic waves per minute in **spaCR field**. The default is **5 waves/minute**; **0** disables popup waves. When enabled, opening a popup immediately starts the first wave from its centre, followed by waves at the selected rate. Moving the popup moves the origin of new waves; closing it stops new waves while existing waves fade. This control is independent of mouse gravity, dot blinking, density and drawing detail."
msgstr "**弹窗波纹频率** 设置 **spaCR field** 中每分钟自动生成的波纹数。默认值为 **5 波/分钟** ；**0** 禁用弹窗波纹。启用后，打开弹窗会立即从其中心发出第一道波纹，后续波纹按所选频率生成。移动弹窗会移动新波纹的起点；关闭弹窗会停止产生新波纹，已有波纹则逐渐消退。此控制与鼠标引力、点闪烁、密度和绘制细节相互独立。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Press **Apply** to preview changes while Preferences stays open. A separate question offers **Keep** or **Revert**. Revert restores the saved and live settings; your edited controls remain available to change or apply again. Closing the question also reverts. **Save** keeps changes and closes Preferences."
msgstr "按 **应用** 预览更改，偏好设置窗口会保持打开。另一个对话框提供 **保留** 或 **还原**。还原会恢复已保存和当前生效的设置；您编辑过的控件仍可继续修改或再次应用。关闭该询问对话框也会还原。**保存** 保留更改并关闭偏好设置窗口。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "**Settings backdrop** remains independent of the main animation during both Apply and Save. **None** disables popup motion while retaining the blue rim. **Settings backdrop darkness** controls the settings card's opacity over its animation, from **0%** to **100%** (default **85%**), combined with **Page opacity**. Page opacity also applies when Settings backdrop is **None**. Higher darkness values cover more of the animation to make text easier to read. Popups remain above their owning spaCR window without using a global always-on-top flag, so other applications can cover them."
msgstr "**设置 Backdrop** 在应用或保存偏好设置时均与主窗口动画保持独立。**无** 关闭弹窗动画，但保留蓝色边缘光。**设置背景暗度** 控制设置卡片覆盖其动画的不透明度，范围为 **0%** 至 **100%** （默认 **85%** ），并与 **页面不透明度** 共同作用。当设置背景为 **无** 时，页面不透明度仍然适用。较高的暗度覆盖更多动画，使文字更易阅读。弹窗只保持在所属 spaCR 窗口前方，不使用全局始终置顶标志，因此其他应用可以覆盖它们。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "In **spaCR field**, left-drag an unoccupied background area to pull a local patch of dots. Releasing the button lets it spring back smoothly without restarting the pattern. This background gesture leaves scientific canvas and control gestures available."
msgstr "在 **spaCR field** 中，按住鼠标左键并在空白背景区域拖动，可拉动一小片局部点阵。松开鼠标后，点阵会平滑回弹，而不会重新启动整个图案。这个背景手势不会占用科学图像画布及控件的操作手势。"

msgid "Arranging the window"
msgstr "排列窗口"

msgid "**Home** keeps its panels in a right-hand column. Drag the column's arrow handle to resize it, or click it to fold the column away and bring it back. The **Text size** slider below the lowest panel scales the text in those panels."
msgstr "**主页** 将其面板放在右侧一列中。拖动该列的箭头手柄可调整其大小，单击它可折叠该列并再次展开。最下方面板下的 **文字大小** 滑块可缩放这些面板中的文字。"

msgid "**The dock**: while it is shown, drag its edge to make it wider or narrower; double-click the edge to fit it to the module names again."
msgstr "**停靠栏**：显示时，拖动其边缘可使其变宽或变窄；双击边缘可使其重新适应模块名称。"

msgid "**A module's right-hand column** (console, actions and the other panels) resizes as one by dragging its left edge. Hold **Ctrl** and scroll over it to make its text larger or smaller; **Ctrl+0** over the column returns to the default size."
msgstr "**模块的右侧列** （控制台、操作和其他面板）通过拖动其左边缘作为一个整体调整大小。按住 **Ctrl** 并在其上滚动可放大或缩小文字；在该列上按 **Ctrl+0** 可恢复默认大小。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "**Tooltips** appear once the pointer has rested on a control for the **Tooltip delay** set in **Preferences → Appearance** (2.0 s by default; 0 shows them at once) and stay while the pointer is on them. The same delay applies to popup tooltips. Fixed hint text at the bottom of Home and Preferences appears immediately. Turn popup tooltips off with **Show tooltips** on the same page."
msgstr "指针在控件上停留达到 **偏好 → 外观** 中设置的 **工具提示延迟** 后，**工具提示** 才会出现（默认 2.0 s；设为 0 会立即显示），并在指针停留期间保持显示。弹出式工具提示使用相同延迟。主页和偏好设置窗口底部的固定提示文字会立即显示。在同一页面通过 **显示工具提示** 可关闭弹出式工具提示。"

msgid "These sizes are remembered between sessions."
msgstr "这些尺寸会在会话之间被记住。"

msgid "To resize a popup, point at one of its edges or corners. A thin blue guide line appears across the middle half of each side you can drag. Drag from anywhere along that edge or corner; the line only marks the side."
msgstr "要调整弹出窗口的大小，请将指针指向其任一边缘或角。可拖动的每条边的中间一半会出现一条细蓝色参考线。可沿该边缘或角的任意位置拖动；参考线只是标示出可拖动的边。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Make Masks corrects masks by hand and carries the Cellpose loop on its masthead. Its canvas has ten tools: Brush, Erase, Erase object, Wand, Draw, Box, Divide / Merge, Zoom, Recrop and Ruler. Wand adds a region by default; hold Ctrl while clicking to remove it. The :doc:`Make Masks reference <make_masks>` covers these tools, Levels, detection settings, primary/secondary pairing, saving and measurement."
msgstr "Make Masks 用于手动修正掩码，并在页眉显示 Cellpose 循环。画布有十种工具：Brush、Erase、Erase object、Wand、Draw、Box、Divide / Merge、Zoom、Recrop 和 Ruler。Wand 默认添加区域；按住 Ctrl 单击即可删除该区域。:doc:`Make Masks 参考 <make_masks>` 介绍这些工具、Levels、检测设置、主/次数据配对、保存和测量。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "**Box** draws independent class-labelled rectangles for YOLO annotation. Move or resize a box, undo or redo edits, and use **Save boxes** to preserve the project or **Export YOLO…** to write normalized labels and ordered class metadata. Source images and segmentation masks remain unchanged."
msgstr "**边界框** 为 YOLO 标注绘制带类别标签的独立矩形。可以移动或调整框的大小、撤销或重做编辑，并使用 **保存边界框** 保存项目，或使用 **Export YOLO…** 写出归一化标签和有序的类别元数据。源图像和分割掩膜保持不变。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Draw traces a free-form outline that closes and fills as a single object -- the tool a brush is not, because a brush stamps disks along the path, so tracing a rim with it labels the rim and leaves the middle background. **Divide / Merge** splits an object with a left-dragged line: the larger component retains its ID and the smaller receives a new one. Right-drag a line across objects to merge them under the first crossed ID, without painting the background between them. Other objects keep their labels."
msgstr "Draw 描绘自由轮廓，将其闭合并填充为单个对象 -- 画笔则沿路径盖印圆盘，因此沿边缘描绘只会标记边缘，中央仍为背景。**分割 / 合并** 用按住鼠标左键拖出的线分割对象：较大的部分保留原 ID，较小的部分获得新 ID。按住鼠标右键拖线跨过多个对象，可将它们合并到第一个被穿过的 ID 下，而不涂绘它们之间的背景。其他对象保留各自的标签。"

msgid "Recrop is the only tool that changes which field is on screen rather than what is painted on it. A staged crop holding several cells is not one training example, and curating it as one teaches a network that two objects are one picture -- so a box round an object writes that region of both the image and the mask as a field of its own, queued straight after the current one, and the multi-object original is retired into ``recropped_originals/`` rather than curated. A box smaller than the minimum side, or one repeating a cut already made, is refused; objects the box cuts through are dropped, because an object whose boundary is where the mouse was released is not that object; and the labels that survive are renumbered from one."
msgstr "Recrop 是唯一会改变屏幕上显示哪个视野、而不是改变其上所绘内容的工具。包含多个细胞的阶段性裁剪图不是一个训练样本，把它当作一个样本校正会让网络误认为两个对象是一张图——因此，围绕某个对象的框会将图像和掩膜的该区域写为一个单独的视野，排在当前视野之后，而多对象的原图会被移入 ``recropped_originals/``，而不是被校正。小于最小边长的框，或重复已有裁剪的框，会被拒绝；被框切到的对象会被丢弃，因为边界落在鼠标释放处的对象已不是原来的对象；保留下来的标签从一开始重新编号。"

msgid "Running Cellpose-SAM from this screen shows its two intermediate outputs beside the mask: the cell-probability map and the flow field. A mask is a threshold applied to that probability map, and a candidate object is discarded when its flows disagree with the ones the network predicted by more than the flow-error threshold. When a mask is wrong, those two panes are where the reason is visible."
msgstr "在此屏幕上运行 Cellpose-SAM 时，会在掩膜旁显示其两个中间输出：细胞概率图和流场。掩膜是对该概率图应用阈值的结果，当候选对象的流场与网络预测的流场之差超过流场误差阈值时，该候选对象会被丢弃。掩膜出错时，原因就体现在这两个窗格中。"

msgid "Settings that apply"
msgstr "适用的设置"

msgid "The settings panel carries a control when it applies to the run being set up and leaves it off the form when it does not:"
msgstr "当某个控件适用于正在设置的运行时，设置面板会显示它；不适用时则不在表单中显示："

msgid "a slot past ``number_of_organelles`` takes its whole block of settings with it, its channel included -- a slot the run does not have is not a slot with its channel left showing;"
msgstr "超出 ``number_of_organelles`` 的槽位会连同其整组设置（包括通道）一起隐藏——运行中不存在的槽位不会只留下一个通道显示在那里；"

msgid "an object whose channel names no plane is not in the run at all, so its settings are not on the form;"
msgstr "通道未指向任何平面的对象根本不在运行中，因此其设置不会出现在表单中；"

msgid "a setting belonging to one morphology is dropped for a slot of another: a punctate organelle has no ridge filter."
msgstr "属于某种形态的设置不会出现在其他形态的槽位中：点状细胞器没有脊线滤波器。"

msgid "The 3D and Time switches declare which dimensions the plate has. ``z_stack`` declares a z axis and enables the volumetric settings -- segmentation mode, anisotropy and voxel size -- and stops with an error rather than guessing which axis is z. ``timelapse`` declares a time axis and reveals tracking; a single-timepoint plate ignores it. The 4D settings apply only when the data is both a z-stack and a time series, and appear only then."
msgstr "3D 和时间开关声明孔板具有哪些维度。``z_stack`` 声明存在 z 轴并启用体数据设置——分割模式、各向异性和体素大小——并且会以错误停止，而不是猜测哪个轴是 z。``timelapse`` 声明存在时间轴并显示跟踪设置；单时间点的孔板会忽略它。4D 设置仅在数据既是 z 栈又是时间序列时适用，也只在那时出现。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Timelapse event annotations and pretrained features (alpha)"
msgstr "Timelapse 事件标注与预训练特征（alpha）"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Enable **Show alpha features** in Preferences to use **Event annotations…** in Timelapse. Choose an existing spaCR tracks CSV and its matching image sequence, open the tracked field and confirm the pairing. Select an observed track and zero-based frame, enter an event name and press **Add or update**. **Save** writes the staged labels to an annotations CSV and selects it for event detection; closing without saving leaves the file unchanged. One track at one frame can have only one event label. Changed tracker or annotation files must be reopened before saving."
msgstr "在 Preferences 中启用 **显示 Alpha 功能**，即可使用 Timelapse 中的 **事件记录...**。选择现有的 spaCR 轨迹 CSV 及其对应图像序列，打开已跟踪的视野并确认配对。选择实际观测到的轨迹和从零开始编号的帧，输入事件名称，然后点击 **添加或更新**。**保存** 将暂存标签写入标注 CSV，并为事件检测选中该文件；关闭而不保存会保持文件不变。同一轨迹在同一帧只能有一个事件标签。轨迹或标注文件发生更改后，必须重新打开才能保存。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "The annotation table names ``field``, ``track_id``, ``frame`` and ``event``; an ``object`` column identifies the tracked object type. Label every event in fields used for training. The event detector evaluates held-out annotated fields, reports precision, recall and timing error, then trains and saves a model for reuse. Event classes come from the experiment's annotations."
msgstr "标注表包含 ``field``、``track_id``、``frame`` 和 ``event``；``object`` 列标识被跟踪对象的类型。请标注训练视野中的每个事件。事件检测器先在保留于训练之外的已标注视野上评估，报告精确率、召回率和时间误差，再训练并保存可复用模型。事件类别来自实验标注。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "The default ``small`` encoder runs on CPU. The optional ``videomae`` encoder uses pretrained video features from **VideoMAE event encoder** in Model Zoo, installed in its own environment. Supply the verified local official checkpoint folder and exactly three ordered source-channel indices; use ``[0,0,0]`` only when deliberately repeating a monochrome channel. The frozen encoder can use CUDA, Metal or CPU; the small event classifier trains on CPU. The checkpoint's Kinetics classes are not microscopy event labels, and pretrained features require held-out evaluation on the intended microscopy experiment. The checkpoint is licensed CC-BY-NC-4.0; inference downloads no weights. These controls remain alpha."
msgstr "默认编码器 ``small`` 在 CPU 上运行。可选编码器 ``videomae`` 使用 Model Zoo 中 **VideoMAE 事件编码器** 提供的预训练视频特征，该后端安装在独立环境中。提供经过验证的本地官方检查点文件夹，以及恰好三个有顺序的源通道索引；仅在有意重复单色通道时使用 ``[0,0,0]``。冻结的编码器可使用 CUDA、Metal 或 CPU；小型事件分类器在 CPU 上训练。检查点的 Kinetics 类别不是显微事件标签，预训练特征必须在目标显微实验的独立保留数据上评估。检查点采用 CC-BY-NC-4.0 许可；推理不会下载权重。这些控件仍属于 alpha。"

msgid "Figure settings"
msgstr "图设置"

msgid "**Preferences → Figures** sets how every spaCR figure looks and how it is saved. The settings apply to figures drawn on screen and to the files the pipelines and the save buttons write; only the settings you change are applied, so a figure keeps its own look for everything else."
msgstr "**偏好 → 图表** 设置每个 spaCR 图表的外观和保存方式。这些设置适用于屏幕上绘制的图表，以及流程和保存按钮写出的文件；只有你更改的设置才会被应用，因此图表在其他方面保留自身的外观。"

msgid "**Text and lines**: font, the sizes of titles, axis labels, tick labels and legend entries (**Legend size**), line width and marker size."
msgstr "**Text and lines** ：字体，标题、轴标签、刻度标签和图例条目的大小（ **Legend size** ），线宽和标记大小。"

msgid "**Colour**: the palette for categories and the **Colormap** for heat maps, images and density plots. ``viridis`` (the default) and ``cividis`` stay readable with colour-blindness and in greyscale."
msgstr "**颜色** ：类别的调色板，以及用于热图、图像和密度图的 **颜色映射** 。 ``viridis`` （默认）和 ``cividis`` 在色盲和灰度下都保持可读。"

msgid "**Layout**: background, grid, axis lines and **Despine offset**, which moves the axis lines away from the data. **Figure width** and **Figure height**, in inches, set the size of new figures; the height applies when the page shape is custom."
msgstr "**布局** ：背景、网格、坐标轴线以及 **Despine offset** （使坐标轴线与数据分开）。 **Figure width** 和 **Figure height** 以英寸为单位设置新图表的大小；当页面形状为自定义时，高度生效。"

msgid "**Saving**: **Format** is PDF, PNG, SVG or TIFF, with its resolution. **Also save** writes a second copy in another format beside each saved figure, for example a PNG next to a PDF. **Vector text** keeps text editable in PDF and SVG files instead of turning it into outlines."
msgstr "**Saving** ： **格式** 为 PDF、PNG、SVG 或 TIFF，并包括其分辨率。 **Also save** 会在每个已保存的图表旁以另一种格式写出第二份副本，例如在 PDF 旁写出 PNG。 **Vector text** 使 PDF 和 SVG 文件中的文字保持可编辑，而不是转换为轮廓。"

#, python-format
msgid "**Bar and point graphs**: **Error bars** shows the standard error (``sem``, the default), the standard deviation (``sd``), a confidence interval at the **CI level** (``ci``), a 95% interval (``ci95``) or nothing. **Error-bar cap size** sets the cap width. **Point overlay** draws the individual points over bar and box graphs, spread by **Jitter width** and drawn with the opacity in **Point alpha**."
msgstr "**Bar and point graphs** ： **误差棒** 显示标准误（ ``sem`` ，默认）、标准差（ ``sd`` ）、按 **CI level** 计算的置信区间（ ``ci`` ）、95% 区间（ ``ci95`` ）或不显示。 **Error-bar cap size** 设置端帽宽度。 **Point overlay** 在柱状图和箱线图上绘制各个数据点，按 **Jitter 宽度** 散开，并以 **点透明度** 中的不透明度绘制。"

msgid "Settings can also differ per graph type. A figure is styled once, so a change you make with its right-click menu is kept when it is saved. Figures that are already drawn with several panels keep their size and resolution; the size and resolution settings apply to new figures and to saved files."
msgstr "这些设置也可以按图表类型分别设置。图表只设置一次样式，因此通过其右键菜单所做的更改在保存时会被保留。已绘制的多面板图表保持其大小和分辨率；大小和分辨率设置适用于新图表和保存的文件。"

msgid "Working with figures"
msgstr "使用图表"

msgid "Right-click any figure in spaCR, in a module's figure list or in an embedded plot such as Graph Builder, the UMAP explorer or a training comparison, to open its figure menu. The Volcano explorer and the Gate Editor keep their own right-click menus and add these entries to them."
msgstr "在 spaCR 中右键单击任意图表——无论是在模块的图表列表中，还是在 Graph Builder、UMAP 浏览器或训练对比等嵌入式图中——即可打开其图表菜单。Volcano 浏览器和 Gate Editor 保留各自的右键菜单，并在其中添加这些条目。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "**Edit figure…** changes the title, axis labels, limits, scales, fonts, colours, legend, size and resolution of this figure. Changes appear as you make them."
msgstr "**编辑图形…** 可更改此图表的标题、坐标轴标签、范围、刻度、字体、颜色、图例、大小和分辨率。更改会即时显示。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "**Change graph type** redraws the figure as another graph that fits its data. Groups can be shown as box, violin, strip, swarm, bar, point or boxen plots, a box or bar plot with points, or as histogram, KDE or ECDF; two measurements as scatter, line, hexbin, KDE or regression plots; one distribution as histogram, KDE, ECDF, box, violin, strip or boxen; counts as a count plot or heat map; and a matrix as a heat map or clustered heat map. The figure is redrawn from its data and keeps your **Figure settings**."
msgstr "**更改图表类型** 会将图表重绘为另一种适合其数据的图。分组可以显示为箱线图、小提琴图、条带图、蜂群图、柱状图、点图或 boxen 图，带点的箱线图或柱状图，或直方图、KDE 或 ECDF；两个测量值可显示为散点图、折线图、hexbin、KDE 或回归图；单个分布可显示为直方图、KDE、ECDF、箱线、小提琴、条带或 boxen；计数可显示为计数图或热图；矩阵可显示为热图或聚类热图。图表会根据其数据重绘，并保留你的 **图设置** 。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "**Statistics…** shows the test spaCR chose for the data and lets you override the **Test**, the **Subject column**, **Paired / repeated measures** and the **Multiple-comparison correction**. **Show on the plot** draws the test and significance brackets on the figure."
msgstr "**统计…** 显示 spaCR 为数据选择的检验，并允许你覆盖 **检验** 、 **受试对象列** 、 **配对数据 / 重复测量** 和 **多重比较校正** 。 **在图上显示** 会在图上绘制检验和显著性括号。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "**Save figure (zip)…** writes one zip file with the figure in your saved format and as PNG, ``data.csv`` with the plotted data, ``statistics.csv`` and ``statistics.txt``, ``spec.json`` with the figure's full recipe, and ``recreate_figure.py``, a script that draws the same figure from the CSV and JSON files without spaCR."
msgstr "**保存图形（zip）…** 写出一个 zip 文件，其中包含以你的保存格式和 PNG 格式保存的图表、包含绘图数据的 ``data.csv`` 、 ``statistics.csv`` 和 ``statistics.txt`` 、包含图表完整配方的 ``spec.json`` ，以及 ``recreate_figure.py`` ——一个无需 spaCR 即可根据 CSV 和 JSON 文件绘制同一图表的脚本。"

msgid "How the statistics are chosen"
msgstr "统计方法如何选择"

msgid "The automatic choice follows the data:"
msgstr "自动选择取决于数据："

msgid "**Groups**: each group is tested for normality (Shapiro–Wilk) and the groups for equal variance (Bartlett, or Levene when a group is not normal). Two groups are compared with Student's t, Welch's t or Mann–Whitney, and paired data with a paired t test or Wilcoxon. Three or more groups get a one-way ANOVA followed by Tukey HSD, Welch's ANOVA followed by Games–Howell, Kruskal–Wallis followed by Dunn, or Friedman followed by pairwise Wilcoxon tests, with pairwise p-values corrected for multiple comparisons."
msgstr "**分组** ：对每组进行正态性检验（Shapiro–Wilk），对各组进行方差齐性检验（Bartlett；若某组不服从正态分布则用 Levene）。两组使用 Student t、Welch t 或 Mann–Whitney 比较，配对数据使用配对 t 检验或 Wilcoxon。三组或更多组使用单因素 ANOVA 加 Tukey HSD、Welch ANOVA 加 Games–Howell、Kruskal–Wallis 加 Dunn，或 Friedman 加两两 Wilcoxon 检验，两两比较的 p 值会进行多重比较校正。"

msgid "**Two measurements**: Pearson or Spearman correlation, chosen by normality."
msgstr "**两个测量值** ：Pearson 或 Spearman 相关，根据正态性选择。"

msgid "**Counts**: chi-square, or Fisher's exact test when an expected count is below 5; tables larger than 2×2 use the Fisher–Freeman–Halton test with a fixed-seed Monte Carlo p-value."
msgstr "**计数** ：卡方检验；当某个期望计数小于 5 时使用 Fisher 精确检验；大于 2×2 的表使用 Fisher–Freeman–Halton 检验，并采用固定种子的 Monte Carlo p 值。"

msgid "**Proportions** (a 0/1 outcome): a two-proportion z test or Fisher's exact test; three or more groups get chi-square followed by corrected pairwise z tests."
msgstr "**比例** （0/1 结局）：两比例 z 检验或 Fisher 精确检验；三组或更多组使用卡方检验，再进行校正后的两两 z 检验。"

msgid "``statistics.csv`` has one row per test, with the test name, groups, statistic, degrees of freedom, p-value, adjusted p-value and correction, effect size, number of observations, whether the test was chosen automatically or by you, and the reason for the choice."
msgstr "``statistics.csv`` 每个检验一行，包括检验名称、分组、统计量、自由度、p 值、校正后 p 值及校正方法、效应量、观测数、检验是自动选择还是由你选择，以及选择的理由。"

msgid "Figures in Graph Builder and the Volcano explorer carry their data rows. For other figures, spaCR reads the plotted values back from the figure; box and violin plots drawn this way keep only their summary, not the individual rows. A new graph type replaces a faceted Graph Builder grid with a single plot until Graph Builder draws the chart again."
msgstr "Graph Builder 和 Volcano 浏览器中的图表携带其数据行。对于其他图表，spaCR 会从图中读回绘制的数值；以这种方式绘制的箱线图和小提琴图只保留摘要，而不保留各个数据行。在 Graph Builder 重新绘制图表之前，新的图表类型会用单个图替换分面的 Graph Builder 网格。"

msgid "Workers and free memory"
msgstr "工作进程与可用内存"

#, python-format
msgid "Before a module starts its workers, spaCR estimates how much memory each worker needs from one input, such as a field, mask, crop batch or table. If the ``n_jobs`` you set would leave less than 12.5% of the computer's RAM free, a popup shows the estimate, the free memory and the number of workers that fit. Choose **Use N workers (recommended)** to run with that number, or keep your own number; Measure then pauses new fields whenever free memory drops below the reserve. **Free RAM by closing applications…** lists your own largest programs. Nothing is ticked at first, and only the programs you tick are asked to quit, after you confirm; they can usually save first, but unsaved work in them may still be lost."
msgstr "在模块启动其工作进程之前，spaCR 会估算每个工作进程处理一个输入（例如一个视野、一个掩膜、一批裁剪图或一张表）所需的内存。如果你设置的 ``n_jobs`` 会使计算机可用 RAM 低于 12.5%，弹出窗口会显示该估算值、可用内存以及可容纳的工作进程数。选择 **使用 N 个工作进程（推荐）** 以该数量运行，或保留你自己的数量；此时只要可用内存低于预留值，测量就会暂停处理新的视野。 **关闭应用程序以释放 RAM…** 会列出你自己占用最大的程序。初始时不勾选任何程序，只有你勾选的程序会在你确认后被要求退出；它们通常可以先保存，但其中未保存的工作仍可能丢失。"

msgid "Runs started without the GUI lower ``n_jobs`` to the safe number and print a warning. Turn ``ram_guard`` off in **Advanced** to keep your ``n_jobs`` unchanged; Measure still waits while free memory is below the reserve."
msgstr "不通过图形界面启动的运行会将 ``n_jobs`` 降低到安全数量并输出警告。在 **高级** 中关闭 ``ram_guard`` 可保持你的 ``n_jobs`` 不变；当可用内存低于预留值时，测量仍会等待。"

msgid "Maturity labels"
msgstr "成熟度标签"

msgid "The API uses these labels consistently:"
msgstr "API 一致地使用以下标签："

msgid "**Stable**"
msgstr "**稳定**"

msgid "Supported entry points used by the principal Mask, Measure, Classify, barcode and regression workflows. Backward-incompatible changes require a deprecation period."
msgstr "主要的掩膜、测量、分类、条形码和回归工作流程所使用的受支持入口点。不向后兼容的更改需要经过弃用期。"

msgid "**Advanced**"
msgstr "**高级**"

msgid "Supported specialist functionality whose defaults or result schema may still evolve. Release notes describe material changes."
msgstr "受支持的专业功能，其默认值或结果模式仍可能演变。发行说明会描述重要更改。"

msgid "**Experimental**"
msgstr "**实验性**"

msgid "Early interfaces intended for evaluation. They may change between minor releases and should be pinned before use in an automated workflow."
msgstr "供评估使用的早期接口。它们可能在次要版本之间发生变化，在自动化工作流程中使用之前应固定版本。"

msgid "**Internal**"
msgstr "**内部**"

msgid "GUI widgets, workers and implementation helpers. They are documented for contributors but are not a compatibility promise."
msgstr "GUI 控件、工作线程和实现辅助函数。它们为贡献者提供了文档，但不构成兼容性承诺。"

msgid "Optional dependencies"
msgstr "可选依赖"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "The base package contains the Qt desktop interface and headless pipelines. Extras add OME-Zarr, OMERO, napari, attribution, tracking, Zernike measurements and vendor readers. Availability varies with Python version; the :doc:`installer guide <installer_guide>` is the authoritative compatibility table."
msgstr "基础包包含 Qt 桌面界面和无图形界面的处理流水线。可选扩展提供 OME-Zarr、OMERO、napari、归因分析、追踪、Zernike 测量以及厂商文件读取器。可用性取决于 Python 版本；:doc:`安装指南 <installer_guide>` 提供权威的兼容性表。"

